      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Zero-field SMM with a single relaxation process (Ueff = 59 K). Under 1 kOe, field-induced dual (FR/SR) relaxation appears; dilution in Y (1@Y) restores one-step relaxation, indicating dual relaxation arises from single-ion anisotropy plus Dy···Dy interactions.",
